Official burned-area perimeter — Tourelhe wildfire (July 2026)
  Attribution: Instituto da Conservação da Natureza e das Florestas, I.P. (ICNF).
  Required form, per the ICNF geoCatalogo conditions of use:
      ICNF, <layer name>, <download URL>, <download date>
  Source: https://www.icnf.pt/api/file/doc/7205ba3d11e327a9
  Reference: ICNF post-fire emergency stabilisation report REE_2026_004, p. 6.
  Processing: converted from Shapefile (EPSG:3763) to WGS84 GeoJSON.
  Licence: open data under the ICNF geoCatalogo conditions of use
  (https://geocatalogo.icnf.pt/dados/condicoes_utilizacao.pdf) — free reuse,
  provided the source is specified in the form above.

