Basemap — OpenFreeMap (public instance)
  OpenFreeMap © OpenMapTiles. Data from OpenStreetMap.
  The project is MIT (https://openfreemap.org/); the public instance needs no
  API key and has no request limit. The map data is OpenStreetMap, under the
  Open Database Licence (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright), and the tile
  schema and styles are OpenMapTiles, under CC-BY 4.0.
  MapLibre shows this attribution automatically in the map's attribution
  control, and it is never hidden.

  (CARTO basemaps were used while building the app and dropped: their 2026
  terms require an API key for the free tier, and this project ships no keys.)

